But MORE IMPORTANT: How should you approach LeetCode?
Since you're starting, follow this process for every problem:

1. Read problem
       ↓
2. Understand input & output
       ↓
3. Make 2-3 examples yourself
       ↓
4. Think of brute-force/simple approach
       ↓
5. Write algorithm in English
       ↓
6. Convert algorithm to code
       ↓
7. Test with edge cases
       ↓
8. Analyze Time & Space Complexity
       ↓
9. Submit
       ↓
10. If wrong → understand why


